Spoilers may follow.


When I descended through Gehennom, I was pretty disappointed to see
that Juiblex, Orcus, and Baalzebub could each be felled with a single
zap from a wand of death.  Come on guys, these are demon lords.  And
it's not like wands of death are rare; I found about one on every
level in Gehennom.

Was I just incredibly lucky to find all these wands of death?
I think demon lords ought to be more resistant to death rays.

Amusing anecdote:
As you may know, Orcus guards the downward staircase on one of the levels
of Gehennom.  During this last game, when I approached him, he quaffed
a potion of gain level.  It was cursed.  He rose up through the ceiling.
So much for guarding the exit...

